  "description": "Judith's life has been nothing but bad luck and endless debt, so she hatches the ultimate scheme: become the contract wife of House Meyus' missing heir, Ekian, fake a pregnancy, and secure a lifetime of comfort. It's the perfect plan... until her supposedly dead husband walks through the door. With a dangerous past, a hidden identity, and family secrets that refuse to stay buried, Ekian's reappearance turns Judith's one-way ticket to the good life into a very complicated marriage.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
